    "title": "Offline Music Player - Mixtube",
    "description": "Mixtube, listen to all your beloved songs free, anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\nImport all your music and audio files quickly; Easy to play all music & audio file formats. \r\nAs MP3 player built-in top quality equalizer takes your sounds listening experience to next level.\r\n\r\n**Why choose Mixtube Music\uff1f**\r\n\u2b50 Non-stop songs with you!\r\nKeep your tube music / audio playing in the background. Whether you are using other apps, or doing other things like housework, work, study, etc.!\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Audio Player for All Type of Audio Formats\r\nNot only an MP3 player, Music Player supports all music and audio formats including MP3, MIDI, WAV, FLAC, AAC, APE, etc. And play them in high quality.\r\n\r\nMore you can find:\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Offline music player, songs player, audio player, mp3 player with high quality.\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 View by all songs, artists, albums, folders and playlist.\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Favorite songs and custom your playlist in mp3 player.\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Lock screen controls and plays in notification bar.\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Widget supported in this powerful audio player.\r\n\r\nMixtube is an offline music player app. It don't support online download songs or music streaming.\r\n\r\nWe have always believed that audio player experience can be something more.\r\n~Enjoy your offline music without limits now! \u2764\r\n\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION:\r\nYou can subscribe to upgrade to premium features\r\n- Premium version offers:\r\n  No Ads: No interruptions to music and videos (no ads)\r\n- Purchasable items: Monthly, Yearly, \"Lifetime\" (non-subscription)\r\n  The specific price is subject to the ipa price, such as the Yearly Premium: 11.99 USD\r\n- Your payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase\r\n- Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period\r\n- Accounts will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period and the renewal fee will be determined\r\n- Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase\r\n- When you cancel your subscription, your subscription will remain active until the end of the subscription period. Auto-renewal will be disabled, but current subscriptions will not be refunded.\r\n- Any unused portion of a free trial period (if offered) will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication (if applicable)\r\n\r\nRead our Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/mixtubemusic/privacy-policy\r\nRead our terms of use: https://sites.google.com/view/mixtubemusic/terms-of-service",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mixtube, listen to all your beloved songs free, anytime, anywhere!<br><br>Import all your music and audio files quickly; Easy to play all music &amp; audio file formats. <br>As MP3 player built-in top quality equalizer takes your sounds listening experience to next level.<br><br>**Why choose Mixtube Music\uff1f**<br>\u2b50 Non-stop songs with you!<br>Keep your tube music / audio playing in the background. Whether you are using other apps, or doing other things like housework, work, study, etc.!<br><br>\u2b50 Audio Player for All Type of Audio Formats<br>Not only an MP3 player, Music Player supports all music and audio formats including MP3, MIDI, WAV, FLAC, AAC, APE, etc. And play them in high quality.<br><br>More you can find:<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Offline music player, songs player, audio player, mp3 player with high quality.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 View by all songs, artists, albums, folders and playlist.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Favorite songs and custom your playlist in mp3 player.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Lock screen controls and plays in notification bar.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Widget supported in this powerful audio player.<br><br>Mixtube is an offline music player app. It don&#39;t support online download songs or music streaming.<br><br>We have always believed that audio player experience can be something more.<br>~Enjoy your offline music without limits now! \u2764<br><br><br>SUBSCRIPTION:<br>You can subscribe to upgrade to premium features<br>- Premium version offers:<br>  No Ads: No interruptions to music and videos (no ads)<br>- Purchasable items: Monthly, Yearly, &quot;Lifetime&quot; (non-subscription)<br>  The specific price is subject to the ipa price, such as the Yearly Premium: 11.99 USD<br>- Your payment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase<br>- Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period<br>- Accounts will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to t